.kaif/install/
KAIF.md
KAIF-LOADER.mjs
KAIF_ADAPTATION_TASK.md
KAIF_UPDATE_TASK.md
KAIF_UPDATE_TASK.superseded.md
KAIF_ADAPTATION_TASK.superseded.md
.kaif/backup-*/
.kaif/heartbeat.log
.kaif/refresh-marker.json

# --- KAGO: ignore-first, before the tool that produces the file exists ---

# The owner's voice portrait — the FULL private core, pulled in on the owner's instruction
# (2026-08-09) so the agent works from the richest version. It carries verbatim quotes from the
# owner's personal writing, and this repository is public: the file lives on disk and never ships.
# Refresh it with: cp d:\work\krinik_voice\AUTHOR_STYLOMETRY.md .
AUTHOR_STYLOMETRY.md

# Dependencies.
node_modules/

# Telemetry and run artefacts: sampler output, sweep logs, captured golden references.
# These are megabytes of one machine's readings — they belong on disk, not in history.
logs/
runs/

# Compiled workload binaries: **the .exe SHIPS** — owner's decision, interview 001 Q3 = B
# (2026-08-09 23:23 +03:00), chosen over the agent's recommendation so KAGO works on a machine
# with no CUDA Toolkit. The ignore line for *.exe that stood here until that answer is REMOVED
# rather than commented out; a cancelled rule left alive keeps steering the tree.
# Build intermediates still have no business in history — they are not the artefact, only its swarf.
workloads/*.obj
workloads/*.exp
workloads/*.lib
workloads/*.pdb
workloads/*.lib.exp

# Measured profiles are machine-specific and unsafe to reuse on another card
# (card-to-card Vmin varies by up to 70 mV — researches/02). Never share them as if portable.
profiles/*.local.json

# Third-party TOOLS the harness drives — downloaded, never authored here, never shipped.
# PresentMon (Intel GameTechDev, MIT) is the frame meter: it reads Windows' own ETW present events,
# so it is vendor-neutral (NVIDIA's FrameView uses it internally). The console build is ONE 956 KB
# exe — no installer, no service, no registry — and deleting the file IS the complete uninstall.
# It does not ship for three reasons: it is not ours to redistribute, its version must match what a
# machine actually downloaded, and a binary in history is a binary nobody re-verifies.
# Provenance and the install recipe: researches/08.
tools/bin/

# Secrets and machine-local overrides.
.env
.env.*
config.local.mjs

# Agent harness permissions for THIS machine (owner's grant, 2026-08-09). Machine-local by
# nature — one owner, one machine — and this repository is public, so the grant never ships.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- owner-review contour: derived pages and session state ---
# The HTML page is DERIVED from the markdown (invariant I1) — the source ships, the render does not.
# Locks carry a pid and a port: they describe one machine at one moment and nothing else.
# NOTE what is deliberately NOT ignored: interviews/decisions/*.json. Those are the owner's
# recorded decisions with by/at provenance — the machine memory that makes the archive readable
# months later. They belong in history.
interviews/*.html
interviews/decisions/*.lock
# The lock the contour actually writes is `.review-lock-<document>.json` — a `.json`, which the
# note above deliberately keeps tracked. Named explicitly, so a pid and a loopback port cannot ride
# into a public repository under the rule that protects the owner's decisions (`bugs/01` → I29).
interviews/decisions/.review-lock-*.json
interviews/decisions/*.preview.html
_probe.html
*.review.html
assets/logo/preview128.png

# Static preview of the run dashboard: a page with ONE pulse baked in, produced by
# `node tools/build-dashboard-page.mjs --preview` for a headless screenshot. It carries one run's
# frozen numbers, so it is a run artefact and never history.
assets/dashboard/_preview.html
.kaif/update-journal.json
.kaif/loop-guard.log
.kaif/loop-guard.lock

# СГЕНЕРИРОВАННЫЕ КАРТЫ ПОЛИГОНА (эпик 67 фаза 4). Каждая воспроизводится из тройки
# (семя, амплитуда, архетип) БАЙТ-В-БАЙТ — это и есть решение 3 журнала эпика: минимизируется и
# хранится ВХОД, а не файл. Пакет из 30 карт весит ~2,5 МБ и переписывается каждым прогоном;
# держать это в истории значит противоречить собственному решению. ИСКЛЮЧЕНИЕ ниже — карта 42:
# её положила сессия 62 намеренно, как улику bugs/68, и она остаётся под версией.
benches/cards/generated/*
!benches/cards/generated/virtual-gpu_42.json
.kaif/loop-guard.out
.kaif/guarded-loop.json
.kaif/update-rehearsal.json
